    },
    {
      "component": "Table",
      "part": "pinButton",
      "key": "pinnedPinIconHover",
      "replacement": "a Tailwind hover:/focus-visible: variant on the part; no attribute needed"
    },
    {
      "component": "OtpInput",
      "part": "input",
      "key": "inputFocused",
      "replacement": "a Tailwind focus: variant on `input`; no attribute needed",
      "evidence": "The key never expressed a tracked state. OtpInput.tsx:303 applies mergedClasses.inputFocused to EVERY slot unconditionally, and its default in utils/constants.ts is the empty string. A consumer setting classes.inputFocused today styles all six inputs, not the focused one. OtpInput tracks no focus index, so there is no state for an attribute to carry \u2014 this is a bug in the key, not a gap in R4."
    }
  ],
